<section id="default" class="button-doc-section">
<h2 class="doc-sub">Botón por defecto</h2>
<p><code>dg-btn</code> es el primario sólido mediano por defecto. Las demás variantes y tamaños son clases completas: no hace falta combinarlas con <code>dg-btn</code>.</p>
<div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo is-plain">
<button type="button" class="dg-btn">default</button>
</div>
<div class="doc-code">
<button class="cp">Copiar</button>
<pre is:raw>&lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn&quot;&gt;default&lt;/button&gt;</pre>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="solidos" class="button-doc-section">
<h2 class="doc-sub">Botones sólidos</h2>
<p>Relleno sólido para acciones de mayor énfasis. Cada variante incluye la base; no necesita <code>dg-btn</code>.</p>
<div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo is-plain">
<div class="dg-cluster">
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-primary">Principal</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-success">Success</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-warning">Warning</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-danger">Error</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-info">Info</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-cancel">Cancel</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="doc-code">
<button class="cp">Copiar</button>
<pre is:raw>&lt;div class=&quot;dg-cluster&quot;&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-primary&quot;&gt;Principal&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-success&quot;&gt;Success&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-warning&quot;&gt;Warning&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-danger&quot;&gt;Error&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-info&quot;&gt;Info&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-cancel&quot;&gt;Cancel&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</pre>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="sutiles" class="button-doc-section">
<h2 class="doc-sub">Botones sutiles</h2>
<p>Misma forma que los sólidos, con relleno crema/claro del color semántico y texto de contraste. Usa <code>dg-btn-subtle</code> para el tono principal o las variantes por color.</p>
<div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo is-plain">
<div class="dg-cluster">
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-subtle">Principal</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-subtle-success">Success</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-subtle-warning">Warning</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-subtle-danger">Error</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-subtle-info">Info</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="doc-code">
<button class="cp">Copiar</button>
<pre is:raw>&lt;div class=&quot;dg-cluster&quot;&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-subtle&quot;&gt;Principal&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-subtle-success&quot;&gt;Success&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-subtle-warning&quot;&gt;Warning&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-subtle-danger&quot;&gt;Error&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-subtle-info&quot;&gt;Info&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</pre>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="outline" class="button-doc-section">
<h2 class="doc-sub">Botones outline</h2>
<p>Borde sólido del color disponible, sin fondo. En hover toma el relleno sutil del mismo tono.</p>
<div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo is-plain">
<div class="dg-cluster">
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-outline">Principal</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-outline-success">Success</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-outline-warning">Warning</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-outline-danger">Error</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-outline-info">Info</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="doc-code">
<button class="cp">Copiar</button>
<pre is:raw>&lt;div class=&quot;dg-cluster&quot;&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-outline&quot;&gt;Principal&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-outline-success&quot;&gt;Success&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-outline-warning&quot;&gt;Warning&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-outline-danger&quot;&gt;Error&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-outline-info&quot;&gt;Info&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</pre>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="solo-texto" class="button-doc-section">
<h2 class="doc-sub">Botones solo texto</h2>
<p>Acciones tipográficas con borde inferior sólido, sin relleno. Útiles como enlaces de acción dentro de un párrafo o fila de herramientas.</p>
<div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo is-plain">
<div class="dg-cluster">
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-text">Principal</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-text-success">Success</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-text-warning">Warning</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-text-danger">Error</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-text-info">Info</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="doc-code">
<button class="cp">Copiar</button>
<pre is:raw>&lt;div class=&quot;dg-cluster&quot;&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-text&quot;&gt;Principal&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-text-success&quot;&gt;Success&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-text-warning&quot;&gt;Warning&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-text-danger&quot;&gt;Error&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-text-info&quot;&gt;Info&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</pre>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="glass" class="button-doc-section">
<h2 class="doc-sub">Botones glass</h2>
<p>Los botones son sólidos por defecto. Añade <code>is-glass</code> cuando el botón esté sobre una imagen, un video o un fondo con color: conserva el color y el texto de su variante, pero el relleno se vuelve translúcido y difumina lo que hay detrás. En hover y foco el relleno se vuelve más sólido en lugar de desvanecerse.</p>
<p>Si el usuario activa <em>reducir transparencia</em> en su sistema, o el navegador no soporta <code>backdrop-filter</code>, el botón vuelve a su color sólido automáticamente. Las variantes solo texto y con degradado no tienen relleno que difuminar e ignoran el modificador.</p>

<h3 class="doc-sub">Sólidos glass</h3>
<p>Para la acción principal sobre una imagen. El texto mantiene el contraste de cada tono.</p>
<div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo glass-stage">
<div class="dg-cluster">
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-primary is-glass">Principal</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-success is-glass">Success</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-warning is-glass">Warning</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-danger is-glass">Error</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-info is-glass">Info</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-cancel is-glass">Cancel</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="doc-code">
<button class="cp">Copiar</button>
<pre is:raw>&lt;div class=&quot;hero&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(hero.jpg)&quot;&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-primary is-glass&quot;&gt;Principal&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-success is-glass&quot;&gt;Success&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-warning is-glass&quot;&gt;Warning&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-danger is-glass&quot;&gt;Error&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-info is-glass&quot;&gt;Info&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-cancel is-glass&quot;&gt;Cancel&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</pre>
</div>
</div>

<h3 class="doc-sub">Sutiles, outline y ghost glass</h3>
<p>Para acciones secundarias. Sutiles usan su tono claro; outline y ghost usan una superficie más transparente para no competir con la acción principal.</p>
<div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo glass-stage">
<div class="dg-cluster">
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-subtle is-glass">Sutil</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-subtle-info is-glass">Sutil info</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-outline is-glass">Outline</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-outline-danger is-glass">Outline error</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-ghost is-glass">Ghost</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="doc-code">
<button class="cp">Copiar</button>
<pre is:raw>&lt;div class=&quot;dg-cluster&quot;&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-subtle is-glass&quot;&gt;Sutil&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-subtle-info is-glass&quot;&gt;Sutil info&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-outline is-glass&quot;&gt;Outline&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-outline-danger is-glass&quot;&gt;Outline error&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-ghost is-glass&quot;&gt;Ghost&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</pre>
</div>
</div>

<h3 class="doc-sub">Grupo glass</h3>
<p>El grupo también es sólido por defecto; con <code>is-glass</code> la cápsula se vuelve translúcida. Combínalo con botones glass o sólidos.</p>
<div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo glass-stage">
<div class="dg-btn-group is-glass" role="group" aria-label="Acciones de la imagen">
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn is-glass">Descargar</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-subtle is-glass">Compartir</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-danger is-glass">Eliminar</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="doc-code">
<button class="cp">Copiar</button>
<pre is:raw>&lt;div class=&quot;dg-btn-group is-glass&quot; role=&quot;group&quot; aria-label=&quot;Acciones de la imagen&quot;&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn is-glass&quot;&gt;Descargar&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-subtle is-glass&quot;&gt;Compartir&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-danger is-glass&quot;&gt;Eliminar&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</pre>
</div>
</div>

<h3 class="doc-sub">Ajustar la transparencia</h3>
<p>Los tokens controlan todos los componentes glass a la vez. Sobre fotos muy contrastadas, sube <code>--dg-glass-alpha</code> para mejorar la legibilidad.</p>
<div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo glass-stage" style="--dg-glass-alpha: 88%; --dg-glass-alpha-soft: 64%">
<div class="dg-cluster">
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-primary is-glass">Más sólido</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-outline is-glass">Outline</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="doc-code">
<button class="cp">Copiar</button>
<pre is:raw>:root {
  --dg-glass-alpha: 72%;       /* sólidos, sutiles y semánticos */
  --dg-glass-alpha-soft: 42%;  /* outline y ghost */
  --dg-glass-alpha-hover: 14%; /* opacidad extra en hover y foco */
  --dg-glass-filter: blur(var(--dg-glass-blur-strong)) saturate(180%);
}

/* O solo en un contenedor */
.hero { --dg-glass-alpha: 88%; }</pre>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="tamanos" class="button-doc-section">
<h2 class="doc-sub">Tamaños de botón</h2>
<p>
<code>dg-btn</code> es el default (mediano implícito). Los tamaños explícitos son clases completas: <code>dg-btn-sm</code>, <code>dg-btn-md</code> y <code>dg-btn-lg</code>. Los mínimos son 80px (5rem), 96px (6rem) y 112px (7rem); el texto largo puede ampliar el botón. Los de solo icono conservan su proporción. También se combinan con cualquier variante de color.</p>
<div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo is-plain">
<div class="dg-cluster">
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-sm">Pequeño</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn">default</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-md">Mediano</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-lg">Grande</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="doc-code">
<button class="cp">Copiar</button>
<pre is:raw>&lt;div class=&quot;dg-cluster&quot;&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-sm&quot;&gt;Pequeño&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn&quot;&gt;default&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-md&quot;&gt;Mediano&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-lg&quot;&gt;Grande&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</pre>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="ancho-movil" class="button-doc-section">
<h2 class="doc-sub">Ancho completo en móvil</h2>
<p>
<code>dg-btn-block-mobile</code> ocupa el 100% del contenedor hasta 991px, el mismo límite de las utilidades móviles del sistema. Desde 992px conserva su ancho natural. Redimensiona la ventana para probarlo.</p>
<div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo is-plain">
<button type="button" class="dg-btn dg-btn-block-mobile">Continuar en móvil</button>
</div>
<div class="doc-code">
<button class="cp">Copiar</button>
<pre is:raw>&lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn dg-btn-block-mobile&quot;&gt;Continuar en móvil&lt;/button&gt;</pre>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="iconos" class="button-doc-section">
<h2 class="doc-sub">Botones con icono y texto</h2>
<p>Combina cada color semántico con un icono acorde del sprite del sistema.</p>
<div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo is-plain">
<div class="dg-cluster">
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-primary">
<svg class="dg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#dg-plus" /></svg> Principal</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-success">
<svg class="dg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#dg-check" /></svg> Success</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-warning">
<svg class="dg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#dg-alert-tri" /></svg> Warning</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-danger">
<svg class="dg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#dg-trash" /></svg> Error</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-info">
<svg class="dg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#dg-info" /></svg> Info</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="doc-code">
<button class="cp">Copiar</button>
<pre is:raw>&lt;div class=&quot;dg-cluster&quot;&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;dg-icon&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;use href=&quot;#dg-plus&quot; /&gt;&lt;/svg&gt; Principal&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-success&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;dg-icon&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;use href=&quot;#dg-check&quot; /&gt;&lt;/svg&gt; Success&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-warning&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;dg-icon&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;use href=&quot;#dg-alert-tri&quot; /&gt;&lt;/svg&gt; Warning&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-danger&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;dg-icon&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;use href=&quot;#dg-trash&quot; /&gt;&lt;/svg&gt; Error&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-info&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;dg-icon&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;use href=&quot;#dg-info&quot; /&gt;&lt;/svg&gt; Info&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</pre>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="solo-iconos" class="button-doc-section">
<h2 class="doc-sub">Botones solo con icono</h2>
<p>Añade <code>dg-btn-icon</code> y siempre proporciona una etiqueta accesible con <code>aria-label</code>. Mismos colores e iconos semánticos.</p>
<div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo is-plain">
<div class="dg-cluster">
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-primary dg-btn-icon" aria-label="Principal">
<svg class="dg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#dg-plus" /></svg>
</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-success dg-btn-icon" aria-label="Success">
<svg class="dg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#dg-check" /></svg>
</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-warning dg-btn-icon" aria-label="Warning">
<svg class="dg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#dg-alert-tri" /></svg>
</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-danger dg-btn-icon" aria-label="Error">
<svg class="dg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#dg-trash" /></svg>
</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-info dg-btn-icon" aria-label="Info">
<svg class="dg-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#dg-info" /></svg>
</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="doc-code">
<button class="cp">Copiar</button>
<pre is:raw>&lt;div class=&quot;dg-cluster&quot;&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-primary dg-btn-icon&quot; aria-label=&quot;Principal&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;dg-icon&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;use href=&quot;#dg-plus&quot; /&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-success dg-btn-icon&quot; aria-label=&quot;Success&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;dg-icon&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;use href=&quot;#dg-check&quot; /&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-warning dg-btn-icon&quot; aria-label=&quot;Warning&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;dg-icon&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;use href=&quot;#dg-alert-tri&quot; /&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-danger dg-btn-icon&quot; aria-label=&quot;Error&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;dg-icon&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;use href=&quot;#dg-trash&quot; /&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-info dg-btn-icon&quot; aria-label=&quot;Info&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;dg-icon&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;use href=&quot;#dg-info&quot; /&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</pre>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="cargando" class="button-doc-section">
<h2 class="doc-sub">Botones de carga</h2>
<p>
<code>is-loading</code> muestra progreso. Usa también <code>disabled</code> y <code>aria-busy="true"</code> para bloquear activación e informar del estado.</p>
<div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo is-plain">
<div class="dg-cluster">
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn is-loading" disabled aria-busy="true">Guardando</button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn-subtle-info is-loading" disabled aria-busy="true">Cargando</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="doc-code">
<button class="cp">Copiar</button>
<pre is:raw>&lt;div class=&quot;dg-cluster&quot;&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn is-loading&quot; disabled aria-busy=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Guardando&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-btn-subtle-info is-loading&quot; disabled aria-busy=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Cargando&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</pre>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="deshabilitados" class="button-doc-section">
<h2 class="doc-sub">Botones deshabilitados</h2>
<p>En botones nativos usa <code>disabled</code>. En enlaces, <code>is-disabled</code> es visual; <code>aria-disabled</code> comunica el estado, pero el consumidor debe bloquear su navegación y activación.</p>
<div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo is-plain">
<div class="dg-cluster">
  <button type="button" class="dg-btn" disabled>No disponible</button>
